                                  id: "Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTgyMDE0NzMzMzUzNzM4MjQ=",
                                  text: "If you got the free $2-$100 bonus. ..💥💥\n\nHere is what you need to do to make a possible withdrawal.\n\nRemember the $250 i got from NGRKing and how i had to play with it before i could withdraw.?\n\nRead here: https://t.co/0CVsvGRVTl\n\nThis is the same case \n\nSo to start, you need to first understand that, what you received is a game bonus and is not instantly withdrawable.\n\nYou would need to make a one time deposit and play any slot game with it, minimum $5\n\nI suggest Sweet Bonanza 2500\n\nso far its been the best paying game for me 😂\n\nStart by betting $0.2 per game\n\nYou are expected to hit and surpass the wager target of 20x the amount you received \n\nIn my own case $8.66 x 20 = $173.2\n\nNote that this can both ways, you might end coming out with a huge bag or less.\n\nNow here is the fact, withdrawing this bonus is not a do or die, you can either decide to forfeit it or go for it.\n\nin my own case i wouldn't be giving it a try, the site doesn't give the vibe of one that wouldn't stress me when i actually want to withdraw 🚨🚨\n\nnow this is the terms and condition for this platform, not totally fair but what can we do about it?\n\nthere would be more coming, just stay active and never stop clicking.\n\non to the next one ✌🏻😎",
