                                  id: "Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM4MTYxOTQ4MzkyMzY2MDg=",
                                  richtext: {
                                    richtext_tags: [],
                                  },
                                  text: "So you got told that I did one $10,800, even though I made multiple buys ranging from $3,000 to $10,000. In total, only $800 was recognized. This effectively means the bonus money is being valued more than my actual cash deposit.\n\nThe promotion advertised “Lose $10K, we will credit you back,” but I was credited the bonus the moment I activated the promo code. I was also told it was a simple 1x wager - completely stress-free. However, when I played Gladiator Slot (betting between $1 and $10), none of my wagers counted toward the requirement - not even a single cent. You can verify this in my account statistics.\n\nI’m not here to damage your reputation. I’m a player who went all-in on my first deposit on a slot and wasn’t overly concerned about the $10K. I simply wanted to try the promotion because it was heavily advertised.\n\nAdditionally, I was never informed that activating this promotion would disable Originals and Live Casino games. After I cancelled the promotion, I reached $25K. I contacted support multiple times, but only received automated AI responses.\n\nRegarding the night shift manager supposedly losing his phone and 2FA access - meaning the entire shift couldn’t access the platform - Metawin could have at least posted an announcement in the chat, on Twitter, or Discord. \n\nPut yourself in my position: my first deposit became locked, support was unresponsive, and there were no updates on the website or Discord. How would you feel? \n\nThe most crazy part is that I only received a ticket update mentioning site-wide withdrawal issues right after I busted my balance.\n\n1/2",
